# What a merchant does NOT receive.
#
# `git archive` reads .gitattributes from within the tree it is archiving. In the
# monorepo this package came from, that meant a root-only file governed a whole-repo
# archive nobody published while every real per-package zip shipped everything below
# it, so the rules had to live inside the package.
#
# This repository IS the package, so root and package are the same tree and the
# distinction no longer bites. The paragraph that used to sit here said phpcs.xml.dist,
# phpstan.neon.dist and phpunit.xml.dist exist only at the repository root and so need
# no rule. That stopped being true on 2026-11-27, when this package got its own four
# after the extraction left the monorepo's behind - they are listed below, and without
# those lines a merchant would receive them.
Test/ export-ignore
docs/screenshots/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
phpunit.xml.dist export-ignore
phpcs.xml.dist export-ignore
phpstan.neon.dist export-ignore
docs-build/ export-ignore
